{"seq":1,"slug":"github-actions","title":"GitHub Actions 持续集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/github-actions","wordCount":439,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"github-actions-持续集成\">GitHub Actions 持续集成</h1><h2 id=\"什么是-github-actions\">什么是 GitHub Actions</h2><p><strong>GitHub Actions</strong> 是 GitHub 原生的 CI/CD 和自动化平台。通过 YAML 文件定义<strong>工作流（Workflow）</strong>，在代码推送、PR 创建等事件触发时自动执行构建、测试和部署任务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir -p .github/workflows\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .github/workflows</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Workflow</td>\n<td>由 YAML 定义的自动化流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Event</td>\n<td>触发 workflow 的事件（push、PR 等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Job</td>\n<td>workflow 中的一组步骤，运行在同一 runner</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step</td>\n<td>job 中的单个任务（运行命令或 action）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Action</td>\n<td>可复用的自动化单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Runner</td>\n<td>执行 job 的虚拟机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Event: push] --&gt; B[Workflow]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Job: build]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Job: test]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Step: checkout]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Step: install]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[Step: build]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Step: checkout]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[Step: test]\">graph TD\n    A[Event: push] --&gt; B[Workflow]\n    B --&gt; C[Job: build]\n    B --&gt; D[Job: test]\n    C --&gt; C1[Step: checkout]\n    C --&gt; C2[Step: install]\n    C --&gt; C3[Step: build]\n    D --&gt; D1[Step: checkout]\n    D --&gt; D2[Step: test]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"基础-workflow\">基础 Workflow</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ci.yml&#10;name: CI&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  build:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup Node.js&#10;        uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: &#39;20&#39;&#10;          cache: &#39;npm&#39;&#10;&#10;      - name: Install dependencies&#10;        run: npm ci&#10;&#10;      - name: Lint&#10;        run: npm run lint&#10;&#10;      - name: Test&#10;        run: npm test&#10;&#10;      - name: Build&#10;        run: npm run build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  push:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    branches:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  pull_request:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    branches:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  build:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    runs-on:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    steps:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> uses:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Setup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Node.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        uses:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        with:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          node-version:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '20'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          cache:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'npm'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dependencies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"矩阵构建\">矩阵构建</h2><p><strong>矩阵构建（Matrix Build）</strong> 并行测试多种环境组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/matrix.yml&#10;name: Matrix CI&#10;&#10;on: [push, pull_request]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  test:&#10;    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]&#10;        node-version: [18, 20, 22]&#10;      fail-fast: false&#10;&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: ${{ matrix.node-version }}&#10;      - run: npm ci&#10;      - run: npm test\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/matrix.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Matrix</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [push, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    runs-on:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ${{ matrix.os }</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    strategy:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      matrix:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        os:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ubuntu-latest, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">macos-latest,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> windows-latest]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        node-version:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [18, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">20,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 22]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      fail-fast:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    steps:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> uses:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> uses:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        with:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          node-version:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ${{ matrix.node-version }</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>矩阵配置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>matrix</code></td>\n<td>定义变量组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fail-fast</code></td>\n<td>false 表示一个失败不取消其他</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exclude</code></td>\n<td>排除特定组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>include</code></td>\n<td>添加额外组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件触发\">事件触发</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>push</code></td>\n<td>推送到指定分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pull_request</code></td>\n<td>PR 创建/更新/合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>schedule</code></td>\n<td>定时执行（cron 表达式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workflow_dispatch</code></td>\n<td>手动触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>release</code></td>\n<td>发布 Release</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>issue_comment</code></td>\n<td>Issue/PR 评论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"on:&#10;  schedule:&#10;    - cron: &#39;0 2 * * 1&#39;  # 每周一凌晨 2 点&#10;  workflow_dispatch:&#10;    inputs:&#10;      environment:&#10;        description: &#39;Deploy environment&#39;&#10;        required: true&#10;        default: &#39;staging&#39;&#10;        type: choice&#10;        options:&#10;          - staging&#10;          - production\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  schedule:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cron:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0 2 * * 1'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 每周一凌晨 2 点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  workflow_dispatch:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    inputs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      environment:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        description:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Deploy environment'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        required:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        default:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'staging'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> choice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        options:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> staging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓存与产物\">缓存与产物</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"      - name: Cache node modules&#10;        uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          path: ~/.npm&#10;          key: ${{ runner.os }}-node-${{ hashFiles(&#39;**/package-lock.json&#39;) }}&#10;          restore-keys: |&#10;            ${{ runner.os }}-node-&#10;&#10;      - name: Upload artifact&#10;        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: build-output&#10;          path: dist/&#10;          retention-days: 7\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Cache</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        uses:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        with:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          path:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.npm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          key:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ${{ runner.os }</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-node-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">${{ hashFiles(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'**/package-lock.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          restore-keys:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ${{ runner.os }</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">}-node-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Upload</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> artifact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        uses:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        with:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build-output</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          path:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          retention-days:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"secrets-与环境变量\">Secrets 与环境变量</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  deploy:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    environment: production&#10;    steps:&#10;      - name: Deploy&#10;        env:&#10;          API_KEY: ${{ secrets.API_KEY }}&#10;          NODE_ENV: production&#10;        run: |&#10;          echo &quot;Deploying to production...&quot;&#10;          ./deploy.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  deploy:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    runs-on:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    environment:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    steps:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Deploy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        env:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          API_KEY:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ${{ secrets.API_KEY }</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          NODE_ENV:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        run:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Deploying to production...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          ./deploy.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远不要在 workflow 文件中硬编码密钥。使用 GitHub Secrets 存储敏感信息，Actions 运行时会自动脱敏日志输出。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常用-actions\">常用 Actions</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>actions/checkout@v4</code></td>\n<td>检出代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>actions/setup-node@v4</code></td>\n<td>配置 Node.js</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>actions/cache@v4</code></td>\n<td>缓存依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>actions/upload-artifact@v4</code></td>\n<td>上传构建产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>codecov/codecov-action@v4</code></td>\n<td>上传测试覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>github/codeql-action@v3</code></td>\n<td>安全代码扫描</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((GitHub Actions))&#10;    核心概念&#10;      Workflow / Job / Step&#10;      Event 触发&#10;      Runner 执行&#10;    构建策略&#10;      矩阵构建&#10;      缓存优化&#10;      产物管理&#10;    安全&#10;      Secrets 管理&#10;      环境隔离&#10;    生态&#10;      官方 Actions&#10;      Marketplace\">mindmap\n  root((GitHub Actions))\n    核心概念\n      Workflow / Job / Step\n      Event 触发\n      Runner 执行\n    构建策略\n      矩阵构建\n      缓存优化\n      产物管理\n    安全\n      Secrets 管理\n      环境隔离\n    生态\n      官方 Actions\n      Marketplace</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>GitHub Actions</strong> 通过 YAML 定义工作流，支持 push、PR、定时等多种触发方式</li>\n<li><strong>矩阵构建</strong>并行测试多种 OS 和运行时组合，<code>fail-fast: false</code> 确保全量测试</li>\n<li><strong>缓存</strong>依赖和构建产物可以显著加速 CI 运行时间</li>\n<li>使用 <strong>Secrets</strong> 安全管理敏感信息，永远不要硬编码密钥</li>\n<li>GitHub Marketplace 提供丰富的<strong>可复用 Actions</strong>，覆盖从构建到部署的全流程</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GitHub Actions 持续集成","id":"github-actions-持续集成"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 GitHub Actions","id":"什么是-github-actions"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基础 Workflow","id":"基础-workflow"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵构建","id":"矩阵构建"},{"level":2,"text":"事件触发","id":"事件触发"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存与产物","id":"缓存与产物"},{"level":2,"text":"Secrets 与环境变量","id":"secrets-与环境变量"},{"level":2,"text":"常用 Actions","id":"常用-actions"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/performance-tuning"},"next":{"title":"Git LFS 大文件存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/git-lfs"}}